  "limitations": [
    "Only 14 learner-subject-years in the data failed, so the fail flag's catch rate rests on very few cases; the grade error (MAE) is measured on every learner and is the more reliable figure.",
    "The final grade is the mean of the term grades, so it contains the first term; the model is measured against simply carrying the first-term grade forward.",
    "Trained on records graded under older transmutation tables; the prediction is anchored on the school's own first-term grade to limit the effect.",
    "The export carries no attendance, so attendance plays no part."
  ]
